# Build context exclusions for the Dockerfiles.
#
# `Dockerfile.debian-slim` stage 1 must copy the repository source,
# because `packages.default` in flake.nix declares `src = ./.` — the
# whole tree. Without lib/ and bin/ the derivation fails with
# `Error: Don't know how to build bin/mathc.exe`. That means a naive
# `COPY . /src/` would otherwise drag the whole working tree into
# the build context, so exclude everything that is derived, local, or
# secret-adjacent.
#
# _build is 283 MB on a warm tree and .git carries the full history;
# neither belongs in a build context. The flake inputs (flake.nix,
# flake.lock, VERSION) are deliberately NOT excluded — they are the
# source of truth for the build.

.git
.dev
_build
result
result/

# Local runtime data; declared as a never-committed storage path in
# .gitignore and irrelevant to the binary build.
.local
decisions/execution-logs.jsonl
scripts/__pycache__
.math/cache

# Test scratch output produced by the cram/adopt fixtures.
tests/_runner_tmp
decisions/1-foo.yaml
decisions/1-use-postgresql.yaml
attestations/t1-2-A0-*.json

# Render snapshots and browser-session artifacts.
assets/_renders
.playwright-mcp
dist